{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "15b80371e05ca1e4",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ARCHER: You—!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_01",
      "hash": "21881e7a92c589fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GRUNT: What is it, Mr. Archer?\\nYou know that kid?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_01",
      "hash": "b87f44ae24543c27",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Huh? [VAR TRNAME(0000)]?\\nYou know that old guy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_02",
      "hash": "21881b7a92c584e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_02",
      "hash": "b87f45ae24543dda",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_02",
      "hash": "15b80671e05ca6fd",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ARCHER: So you’re fool enough to get in our\\nway, is that it?\\c\\nWhat brave little [VAR GENDBR(00FF,0804)]boyschildren."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_03",
      "hash": "b87f46ae24543f8d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: ...Wait, aren’t they the ones\\nwho are getting in our way?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_03",
      "hash": "21881c7a92c58697",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GRUNT: Not even!\\nMr. Archer’s saying you’re in his way, all right?!\\r\\nYou want to go home in tears or what?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_03",
      "hash": "15b80571e05ca54a",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ARCHER: Calm yourself!\\c\\nI’ll teach these children a good lesson."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0910_dummy_01",
      "hash": "1a424c7cf4a00727",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0910_dummy_02",
      "hash": "1a424d7cf4a008da",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketchief_04",
      "hash": "15b80071e05c9ccb",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ARCHER: So it wasn’t just a stroke of luck that\\nlet you beat me last time...\\c\\nI understand now.\\nWe’ll have to be more careful about you two."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rocketf_04",
      "hash": "2188197a92c5817e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GRUNT: Outta the way!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_04",
      "hash": "b87f3fae245433a8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Ow!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_05",
      "hash": "b87f40ae2454355b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey, look!\\nThat Grunt dropped something!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0910_sys_01",
      "hash": "7e91e0790e71c998",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You took the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Card Key[VAR COLOR(0000)] from [VAR TRNAME(0001)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0910_rival_06",
      "hash": "b87f41ae2454370e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: We’ll just borrow this until all\\nSilph is free!"
    }
  ],
